---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Host IMX"
  description="How to propose hosting a future edition of ACM IMX: what makes a strong bid, evaluation criteria and the bidding guidelines."
>
  <div class="container page prose">
    <h1>Host IMX</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The Steering Committee welcomes proposals to host future editions of IMX. Applications are accepted on
      an ongoing basis.
    </p>
    <p>
      Send proposals to the Steering Committee at <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Growth and diversity</h2>
    <p>
      IMX is committed to growth and diversity. We encourage bid organisers to say how they will inject fresh
      thinking, diverse participation and new ideas into the IMX community. This can be done in many ways,
      for example:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>collaborating with colleagues in regions that are under-represented at IMX</li>
      <li>focusing on topics of particular interest to those communities</li>
      <li>curating tracks or workshops</li>
      <li>hosting the conference in a new region, with options for remote participation</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We are sure there are other ideas we have not considered, and we look forward to hearing from you.</p>
    <p>IMX has been held across Europe, North America, Asia and South America.</p>

    <h2>Timing</h2>
    <p>The conference is typically held in June.</p>

    <h2>What makes a strong bid</h2>
    <p>Particularly strong proposals include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>plans to engage local universities and the technology or media industry in the host region</li>
      <li>plans to help IMX broaden diverse thinking in its community</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Evaluation criteria</h2>
    <p>Bids are evaluated on:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>location</li>
      <li>venue</li>
      <li>dates</li>
      <li>a good start on the organising committee, including affiliations</li>
      <li>diversity</li>
      <li>budget</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Please include plans for remote or hybrid participation, and for managing any disruption that could
      affect registration or attendance.
    </p>

    <h2>Bidding guidelines</h2>
    <p>
      To help us compare venues objectively, please prepare your proposal following the
      <a href={url('files/imx-bidding-guidelines.pdf')}>IMX bidding guidelines (PDF)</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>How decisions are made</h2>
    <p>
      Decisions about future hosts are made by the IMX Steering Committee. Please get in touch early to discuss
      your ideas or ask questions.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
